    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo></math>{<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mi>n</mi></msqrt><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#10877;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&#10877;</mo><mn>50</mn></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math>&nbsp;is odd}.&nbsp;Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>S</mi></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"right\"><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>.&nbsp;If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>&#931;</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></munder><mo>det</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>adj</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal to"
