  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We know that</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Here&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;matrix</p><p>so&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>Now find&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>&#931;</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></munder><mo>det</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>adj</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#931;</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>48</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>50</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>25</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>25</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>26</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>51</mn></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>221</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></math></p>"
